title: Authorizations › Case page › Draft › Checks, versions and send back
route: /authorizations/case/R-1042?tab=draft
intro: The right column of the Draft tab: Integrity's four checks and 'Re-check', the version list and its read-only viewer, and 'Send back to Scribe'.
dir: TD
also: Demo only: 'Re-check' and 'Send back to Scribe' are simulated waits. Sending back logs the request and shows a toast but does not redraft the text.
---
start s1 "On the Draft tab, look at the right column"
screen ck "Card 'Checks'\n'Integrity's four checks'\nPill 'All clear' or '2 open'"
process c1 "'Every sentence matches the chart'"
process c2 "'Payer criteria are covered'"
process c3 "'Dates are consistent'"
process c4 "'Identifiers are protected'"
decision dok "Does each check pass?"
process pass "Green tick and 'Pass'"
process warn "Amber triangle, 'Warn' and a note\ne.g. 'Sertraline start is 9/14 in the medication list and 9/21 in the psychiatric evaluation.'"
process why "A warning clears when the matching action is applied\n(criteria and dates), or on 'Re-check' after an edit (chart)"

click rc "Click 'Re-check'"
agent ig "Integrity reads the draft again\nSpinner on the button for about 1.6 seconds\n(demo: simulated)"
store mr "Edit flag cleared\nLog: 'Integrity read the draft again'"
decision dst "Do other checks still warn?"
toast t1 "'All four checks passed'\n'Integrity read every sentence against the chart again.'"
toast t2 "'1 check needs an action'\n'Apply the matching recommendation, then check again.'"

screen vs "Card 'Versions'\nNewest first: 'Version 3', time, author, note"
process cu "Newest row carries a 'Current' pill\nOlder rows have 'View'"
click vw "Click 'View' on an older version"
overlay vm "Dialog 'Version 2'\nTime and author. 'Read only.' Then the text"
click vc "Click 'Close', the X, the dimmed area, or press Esc"
process vn "A new version appears after every Apply\n('Scribe', 'Added 6 recommendations')\nand every saved edit ('You', 'Edited by you')"

screen sb "Bottom card\n'Send to payer' (a disabled 'Sent to payer' once the payer has it), 'Send back to Scribe', and a note"
click sk "Click 'Send back to Scribe'"
process bz "Spinner for about 1.4 seconds"
store lg "Log: 'You sent the draft back to Scribe'"
toast tb "'Sent back to Scribe'\n'Scribe will redraft the summary and Integrity will check it again.'"
goto gS "Continues in: Authorizations › Case page › Draft › Review, sign and what happens next"

s1 --> ck --> c1 & c2 & c3 & c4
c1 --> dok
c2 --> dok
c3 --> dok
c4 --> dok
dok -->|Yes| pass
dok -->|No| warn --> why
ck --> rc --> ig --> mr --> dst
dst -->|No| t1
dst -->|Yes| t2
s1 --> vs --> cu
cu --> vw --> vm --> vc
vs --> vn
s1 --> sb --> sk --> bz --> lg --> tb
sb --> gS
